[11:03:57] Data checks done: 1187 dementia-task recordings, durations 301-1512 s (median 847 s). Splits: train 950 / val 119 / test 118; no-overlap test 90 is a subset of test. Writing the design now.
[design] Approach 11 = SANF-Net (State-Aware, age-Normative Fusion network). Novel parts:
[design]  1. Uses the CAUEEG event annotations (eyes-closed / eyes-open / photic / hyperventilation / artifacts), with the pause-offset fix
[design]  2. Reactivity biomarkers: alpha suppression from eyes-closed to eyes-open, and photic driving response
[design]  3. Age-normative z-scores: each biomarker is scored against train-set Normals of the same age (separates age from EEG)
[design]  4. Ordinal head (Normal < MCI < Dementia) plus focal CE; same-class bag mixing
[design]  Borrowed from CEFA-Net: clinical-ratio biomarker branch, multi-scale conv + squeeze-excitation, focal loss with heavier MCI weight, ensembling
[design] Layout: src/{common,data,features,models,training,evaluation}, scripts/00-05, artifacts/ (all generated files stay inside this folder)
